e, co_qualname, co_filename or co_flags changed (the generator, coroutine and iterable"] [450 1 "// coroutine bits of co_flags; the others are the IR's own)."] [495 5 "// the constants the instructions index (PY6b's request: test_marshal replaces them)"] [500 5 "// co_consts reads the view's order: each constant replaced where the IR holds it (queue 229)"] [521 6 "// the view's (bytecode_asm.go): the machine runs the IR"] [534 15 "// a new code object (the copy took the original's)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[69 46] [95 41] [171 27] [177 113] [209 26] [283 24] [288 24] [293 24] [298 24] [303 24] [327 25] [337 24] [344 23] [349 51] [381 27] [501 26] [522 27] [524 58]]} (go/file "funcattrs.go" :imports [])

